  "summary": "Genuine explicit complete FlowCheckpointV3 wire APIs, complete nonowning scan before ownership, complete measurement before canonical/output allocation, checked native and aggregate limits, exact mode coverage, seven private proof families. Legacy source preserved byte-for-byte.",
  "proof_shape": {
    "rich_fixture": "Real Deferred capacity2 resource, two Active and two Queued requests, Eager resource and zero-duration completion notification, registered stable continuation, nonempty context/restart/factory payloads, pending gates and Flush commands. Native restore/recapture plus bounded uninterrupted suffix equivalence before mutations.",
    "structural_tags": "Separate WIRE ONLY synthetic complete command DTO for tags0..13, Pause/Resume, flag false/true, Eager/Deferred; no runtime acceptance claim.",
    "phase_counters": "Thread-local V3 owned decode, canonical validation and output allocation entry counters with valid positive controls; malformed final mode/trailing reject with owned count0; late payload/byte reject with canonical/output count0.",
    "bounds": "Exact and cap+1 encode/decode controls for every positive scalar/aggregate collection cap, independent resource flags/modes, four-kind pending, world free/live, actor-domain, queue/allocation/deadline/preempting nested caps, nested callback registrations, component/sparse/key/payload/restart/factory, huge aggregate overflow versus small count cap.",
    "native_boundary": "Complete structurally decoded Flush joins rejected natively before codec for kind/entity/resource/mode/pending Remove; valid restore invokes codecs."
  },
